<text><body><div type="page" n="217"><pb n="217" facs="#f0229"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">2. Landwirthschaft.</fw>
<table xml:id="p217-b1" facs="#f0229-b1" rows="11" cols="9"><row role="label"><cell role="label">Arten der Benutzung.</cell><cell role="label">Im Allgemeinen. <placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName>. Morgen.</cell><cell role="label">Im Allgemeinen. <placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName>. Morgen.</cell><cell role="label">Im Allgemeinen. <placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lobenstein-Ebersdorf</placeName>. Morgen.</cell><cell role="label">Im Allgemeinen. Fürstenthum. Morgen.</cell><cell role="label">In Procenten. <placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName>. Morgen.</cell><cell role="label">In Procenten. <placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName>. Morgen.</cell><cell role="label">In Procenten. <placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lob.-Ebersd.</placeName> Morgen.</cell><cell role="label">In Procenten. Fürstenthum. Morgen.</cell></row><row><cell><rs type="concept" ref="#concept-gehoeft">Gehöfte</rs> . . .</cell><cell>804,45</cell><cell>556</cell><cell>413,75</cell><cell>1774,20</cell><cell>0,93</cell><cell>0,44</cell><cell>0,38</cell><cell>0,55</cell></row><row><cell><rs type="concept" ref="#concept-garten">Gärten</rs> und <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-obstplantage">Obstanlagen</rs></cell><cell>2356,32</cell><cell>1138</cell><cell>668,14</cell><cell>4162,47</cell><cell>2,73</cell><cell>0,90</cell><cell>0,61</cell><cell>1,29</cell></row><row><cell><rs type="concept" ref="#concept-feld">Feld</rs> *) . . .</cell><cell>50077,96</cell><cell>40841</cell><cell>29227,01</cell><cell>120146,96</cell><cell>57,95</cell><cell>32,34</cell><cell>26,56</cell><cell>37,22</cell></row><row><cell><rs type="concept" ref="#concept-wiese">Wiese</rs></cell><cell>7816,33</cell><cell>25226</cell><cell>20770,00</cell><cell>53812,33</cell><cell>9,04</cell><cell>19,98</cell><cell>18,88</cell><cell>16,67</cell></row><row><cell><rs type="concept" ref="#concept-hutung">Hutung</rs> . . .</cell><cell>2436,76</cell><cell>4169</cell><cell>3815,08</cell><cell>10420,83</cell><cell>2,82</cell><cell>3,30</cell><cell>3,47</cell><cell>3,23</cell></row><row><cell><rs type="concept" ref="#concept-teich">Teiche</rs></cell><cell>145,25</cell><cell>1422</cell><cell>205,71</cell><cell>1772,75</cell><cell>0,17</cell><cell>1,13</cell><cell>0,19</cell><cell>0,55</cell></row><row><cell><rs type="concept" ref="#concept-laubholz">Laubholz</rs> . . .</cell><cell>5968,81</cell><cell>332</cell><cell>277,13</cell><cell>6578,94</cell><cell>6,91</cell><cell>0,26</cell><cell>0,25</cell><cell>2,04</cell></row><row><cell><rs type="concept" ref="#concept-nadelholz">Nadelholz</rs> . . .</cell><cell>14975,58</cell><cell>50429</cell><cell>52421,01</cell><cell>117825,59</cell><cell>17,33</cell><cell>39,92</cell><cell>47,64</cell><cell>36,51</cell></row><row><cell>Steuerfreier Boden **).</cell><cell>1834,99</cell><cell>2189</cell><cell>2228,00</cell><cell>6251,99</cell><cell>2,12</cell><cell>1,73</cell><cell>2,02</cell><cell>1,94</cell></row><row><cell>Summe des Flächeninhalts</cell><cell>86416,46</cell><cell>126302</cell><cell>110025,83 ***)</cell><cell>322746,29</cell><cell>100,00</cell><cell>100,00</cell><cell>100,00</cell><cell>100,00</cell></row></table>
<p xml:id="p217-b2"><lb n="23" facs="#f0229-l23"/>Der landwirthschaftliche Boden vertheilt sich nach den Landest<lb n="24" break="no" facs="#f0229-l24"/>heilen:</p>
<table xml:id="p217-b3" facs="#f0229-b3" rows="5" cols="5"><row role="label"><cell role="label">Landestheile.</cell><cell role="label">Zahl der Morgen allgemein.</cell><cell role="label">Zahl der Morgen in Procent.</cell><cell role="label">Zahl der Morgen auf 1 □ M.</cell><cell role="label">Zahl der Morgen auf 1 Familie.</cell></row><row><cell><placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName></cell><cell>62688</cell><cell>33,2</cell><cell>15555,3</cell><cell>7,84</cell></row><row><cell><placeName ref="#place-schleiz">Schleiz</placeName></cell><cell>71574</cell><cell>38,0</cell><cell>11929,0</cell><cell>11,60</cell></row><row><cell><placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lobenstein-Ebersdorf</placeName></cell><cell>54480</cell><cell>28,8</cell><cell>10896,0</cell><cell>11,37</cell></row><row><cell>Das Fürstenthum</cell><cell>188542</cell><cell>100,0</cell><cell>12544,3</cell><cell>10,00</cell></row></table>
<p xml:id="p217-b4"><lb n="28" facs="#f0229-l28"/>Der landwirthschaftliche Boden nach den Hauptgrundbesitzern vertheilt:</p>
<p><note place="foot" n="*)" xml:id="p217-fn1" facs="#f0229-fn1"><lb n="29" facs="#f0229-l29"/>Die Feldfläche hat zwar seit 1854 einen Zuwachs, den stärksten im Landestheile <lb n="30" facs="#f0229-l30"/><placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName>, einen weniger bedeutenden in den beiden anderen Gebieten erhalten, da jedoch nicht <lb n="31" facs="#f0229-l31"/>vorliegt, wie viel <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-feld">Feldboden</rs> je vom Areal der <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-hutung">Hutung</rs>, der Laub- und Nadelwaldung ge<lb n="32" break="no" facs="#f0229-l32"/>nommen wurde, so ist das Jahr 1854 als Grundlage der Angaben über die Landwirthschaft <lb n="33" facs="#f0229-l33"/>beibehalten worden.</note><note place="foot" n="**)" xml:id="p217-fn2" facs="#f0229-fn2"><lb n="34" facs="#f0229-l34"/>Zum steuerfreien Boden gehören die <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-schloss">Schlösser</rs> des fürstlichen Hauses, die dem <lb n="35" facs="#f0229-l35"/>Staate eigenthümlichen <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-gebaeude">Gebäude</rs> und Grundstücke, die <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-kirche">Kirchen</rs>, öffentlichen <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-weg">Wege</rs>, <rs type="concept" ref="#concept-fluss">Flüsse</rs>,<lb n="36" facs="#f0229-l36"/> Oedungen tc.</note><note place="foot" n="***)" xml:id="p217-fn3" facs="#f0229-fn3">Der Landestheil <lb n="1" facs="#f0229-l1"/><placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lobenstein-<lb n="3" facs="#f0229-l3"/>Ebersdorf</placeName> ist nur <lb n="37" facs="#f0229-l37"/>croquirt, daher sein Flächenmaß <lb n="38" facs="#f0229-l38"/>nicht ganz sicher, vermuthlich größer als die obige Angabe.</note></p>
</div></body></text>
